# Action de pick & place de alto nivel.
# Goal: objeto a recoger + punto de drop (en world).
# Result: success + reason + duracion total.
# Feedback: fase actual del pipeline + progreso normalizado [0,1] +
#   indice de fase para correlar con el evidence_logger.

# Goal
string object_name
geometry_msgs/Point drop_xyz_world
---
# Result
bool success
string reason
float64 duration_sec
int32 cycles_completed
---
# Feedback
string current_phase
float32 progress
int32 phase_index
string detail
